    "text": "<p>Buna-S is an elastomer<br /><br />Buna-N is a synthetic polymer<br /><br />Buna-S is polymerised by addition polymerisation method which needs radical initiator for chain propagation step. Nascent oxygen can be used as an Radical initiator.<br /><br />Neoprene is a synthetic rubber.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a90f48a4-6bdd-46de-98a1-3b0bfe008507-image.png\" style=\"width: 476px; height: 101px;\" /></p>",
